WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:50.190
Someone once said...

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:55.260
There is sweet, creamy, cool ice cream

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:57.760
with crunchy, fragrant cones

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:01.230
that grows in a cucumber-like form...

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:05.770
Ice Creacumbers!

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:09.900
There are crisp yellow pickled 
radishes that go well with rice

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:13.170
and grow as fine horns on 
certain stag beetles...

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:17.880
Pickled Stag Beetlishes!

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:21.280
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:27.350
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:33.290
There are four more training 
ingredients that Ichiryu,

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:35.630
the president of IGO, asked Toriko to get.

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:38.730
In order to capture the Shining Gourami,

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:43.800
Toriko and company headed for a cavern 
inside Death Falls in the Mors Mountains.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.070
We're going to be crushed!

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:51.240
Hey! This is no time to be spacin' 
out with a silly grin on your face!

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:56.020
Take this! 5x Super Spatula!

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:03.020
Toriko witnessed the results 
of Sunny's training.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.120
Instinct?

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:07.960
That's right. Instinct!

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:12.000
Under the guidance of Guemon, 
the Gourmet Gang Leader,

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:16.070
Sunny learned how to be strong 
by operating on instinct.

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:24.110
Then I'll believe in that instinct, too!

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:35.050
18 plus 18...

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:41.090
You...

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:44.930
Take this... 36-fold...

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:49.270
...Twin Spiked Punch!

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:58.240
30 Times Combo! 36-fold Twin Spiked Punch!

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:14.060
Yes! I made it through!

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:19.060
What awesome power! That was amazing!

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:25.670
But like I figured, it put 
a heavy strain on my arms.

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:29.070
That probably consumed 
a million kilocalories.

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:32.640
That's twice as much as 
Leg Knife or Leg Fork.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:34.980
So of course I can't do it rapid-fire.

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:36.050
Toriko-san...

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.110
Toriko...

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:52.190
It took me a long time to learn 
the power of "intuition",

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:54.330
but he grasped it just by watching me.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:56.060
What an incredible man...

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:03.000
Well, Toriko has already acquired an 
enormous amount of battle experience.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.870
This time, he probably just put faith 
in the power of intuition he already had

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:09.040
and entrusted his body to it.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.950
What's sustaining Toriko's growth

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:16.080
is his overwhelming sense 
as a Gourmet Hunter.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.790
I'm actually a little jealous...

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:22.120
Come on, let's hurry forward 
while we have the chance!

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:23.090
Right!

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.100
What's wrong, Sunny?!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.300
What is it, Queen?

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:35.700
Is it gonna "talk"?

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:40.340
No, snakes don't have well 
developed vocal organs.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:43.740
Queen isn't releasing a 
voice, but her pheromones.

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:44.910
Pheromones?

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:49.580
Warning pheromones that my intuition catches.

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:56.790
Snakes can use their forked tongue to 
detect which way a smell is coming from.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:01.060
By flicking her tongue, she can calculate 
the location of prey or enemies.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:03.200
Warning... Don't tell me...

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:04.230
Something's coming!

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.060
What?!

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.040
What the...?! Tons of rocks!

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:14.710
Toriko! Matsu! Hurry! We need 
to get through this waterfall!

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:20.010
I've got a bad feeling about this... 
though it's just intuition...

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:35.830
What the devil is that?!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.060
A gigantic rock!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:41.500
No, it's... a mountain!

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:44.900
An entire mountain streaming down the falls?!

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:47.070
And no average-sized one either!

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:49.640
It looks to be 5,000 meters tall!

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:54.310
This is bad! We're still about halfway 
out! I don't think we can avoid it!

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.910
Leg Knife!

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.490
No dice! It's just too big!

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:04.590
Sunny! Super Spatula!

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:07.830
Sunny-san, please! Do it beautifully!

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:13.000
It's my goal to eventually 
repel a planet-sized meteor,

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.330
but to be honest, right 
now, this is impossible!

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:18.140
My Super Spatula uses my sensors...

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:21.140
That is, my hair, to change 
the flow of the force

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:22.810
and send it back to the enemy.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:26.080
It takes a certain amount 
of stamina in my hair.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:30.750
Right now, one strand of my hair has 
tensile strength of about 300 kilos.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:34.380
With one strand, I can fend 
off 1000 times that power,

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:37.050
but the hair can't stand any 
more than that. It'll break.

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:41.760
In other words, with 300,000 strands, 
your limit is 90 million tons.

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:45.630
This mountain is too heavy. It's 
probably several trillion tons.

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:49.770
But you turned back a waterfall that must've 
weighed several hundred million tons, right?

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:53.500
That's because a waterfall isn't solid 
like that mountain, it's liquid.

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:56.840
I didn't repel the whole thing, 
just the water in front of us.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:59.210
Would my Twin Spiked Punch 
be useless here too?

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:02.080
Then what are we going to do?!

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:08.220
Sunny! Your Super Spatula...

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:11.550
Can you only deflect power 
in the opposite direction?

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:12.850
What do you mean?

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:16.190
Can you change the direction 
in which you repel the power?

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:17.730
Direction of the power?

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:19.230
Listen!

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:22.030
What are you thinking, Toriko?

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:23.870
You understand, don't you?!

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:25.130
Are you serious?!

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:28.600
You're telling me to deflect your 
punch upward?! I've never done that!

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:31.570
Do it, Sunny! This is our only chance!

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:34.080
Otherwise, the three of 
us are gonna be crushed!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.280
Alright, fine. I'll give it a shot.

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:47.050
Using all 300,000 of my sensors...

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:50.920
Of course! If you don't, that mountain 
won't give as much as an inch!

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:55.030
This brings back memories... 
A combination attack...

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:56.660
Here I go, Sunny!

00:08:57.460 --> 00:09:05.070
36-fold Twin Spiked Punch!

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:09.040
30x Super Spatula!

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:23.620
How's that?!

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:35.400
My Spiked Punch is a technique that 
penetrates and destroys from the inside!

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:41.040
And with Sunny's Super Spatula, 
the power is magnified even more!

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:44.810
That's 30x 36-fold!

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.050
So crumble to pieces already!

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:05.330
We did it!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.800
You broke the mountain 
apart and I repelled it!

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:09.770
And those are...

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:11.300
I see 'em!

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:14.000
Caves inside the waterfall!

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:29.050
Caves inside the waterfall!

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:36.190
Here it comes! Death Falls is pushing 
the crushed mountain right back at us!

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:37.230
Quickly, to the caves!

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:39.360
Toriko-san?!

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.200
No good... I used too many techniques.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.200
I don't have any strength left.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.700
Slacker!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:49.270
I went through the last of my 
strength like ten minutes ago!

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:50.910
Let's move!

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:42.220
Talk about making it by a hair's breadth...

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:44.760
Sunny-san...

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.660
Are you okay, Sunny?!

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:49.330
What I did...

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:53.030
...exhausted me. I don't have 
any strength left either...

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:54.770
Plus, that Twin Spiked Punch...

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:58.040
It's the first time I ever deflected 
something that powerful.

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:03.310
I was able to destroy the mountain... 
but I used up all my energy.

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:08.220
Me too. I meant to increase 
my maximum energy limit,

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:12.050
but I'm empty. I couldn't take another step.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:20.090
Toriko-san... Sunny-san...

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:25.270
You two used up all of your energy 
getting us through Death Falls...

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:29.470
And we finally made it here.

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:34.610
From here on... From here on, I'll...

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:37.040
Hey, Komatsu...

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.010
Komatsu...?!

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:40.410
Yes?!

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:42.480
Ain't there somethin' to eat around here?

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:44.820
The two of us are gonna be useless 
'til we get somethin' in our bellies.

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:46.750
Food?

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:49.860
There is! And it's first-rate!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:52.320
Shining Gourami!

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:54.930
Wait here! It'll be ready soon!

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:56.430
Matsu! You...

00:12:56.430 --> 00:13:01.230
You two should relax! The rest is my job!

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:03.670
You intend to go alone?! Wait a second!

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:04.540
Sunny!

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:08.010
What are you doing, Toriko?! Are you 
insane?! Letting him go off on his own...

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:10.810
It could be like a labyrinth in there!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.180
And you call yourself Matsu's partner?!

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:18.280
I don't especially smell any Beasts from 
within the cave. I think it's okay!

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:21.050
And how would you know that?!

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:23.050
Just intuition!

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:33.400
As Toriko-san's partner, I have 
to do my part for both of us!

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:37.840
I've traveled together with 
Toriko-san all this time...

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:40.040
I'm prepared for a little danger!

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.040
A cold breeze...

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:50.450
I see... The temperature's 
lower deeper inside the cave.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:54.080
Nothing that should make me give pause...

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:18.470
It's dark...

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:22.040
If I keep going like this, I may get lost.

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:38.030
Melk Stardust, which we got on my first 
journey with Toriko-san as his partner...

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:45.030
It's a precious seasoning...

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:56.040
...and now it's a precious 
guidepost that'll save my life.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:59.980
Of course, I'll collect it on my 
way back so it doesn't go to waste.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:09.460
A Potato Eel!

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:13.290
It's small and ugly, but eating it 
should rebuild my strength a little.

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:15.430
Want a bite, Toriko?

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.730
No, I'll pass.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:22.500
Komatsu said to wait.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:26.910
I'm gonna wait patiently for Komatsu 
to get back with the Shining Gourami.

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:29.240
You really have faith in him, huh?

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:32.010
Do you have grounds for that beautiful faith?

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:37.480
Komatsu possesses a rare 
kind of Gourmet Luck.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:43.320
Huh? I came out a different cave exit.

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:45.760
I took the wrong path.

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:49.460
He has a natural gift for being 
loved by and led by ingredients.

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:52.400
Gourmet Luck, eh?

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:13.050
Just my own shadow...

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:22.360
Gourmet Luck is a simple thing, isn't it?

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:27.630
I have a feeling that us using up all our 
strength and Komatsu going on his own

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.700
is no coincidence.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.070
Or that's what my intuition says, anyway.

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:48.020
This is...

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:18.050
What a light!

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:23.090
There's no doubt about it! 
That's a Shining Gourami!

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:29.830
What? A Mother Snake?

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:30.860
Yes, sir.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:33.030
Apparently, the snake is still 
little more than a hatchling,

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:35.860
but we've gotten many eyewitness 
reports of a long body

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:38.730
stretching towards the foot 
of the Mors Mountains.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:45.340
Toriko... He probably thought he could 
capture the Shining Gourami with Sunny.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:50.350
If I recall, the Shining Gourami's 
Capture Level is over 80...

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:54.020
That's the level to get through Death Falls.

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:55.380
As a matter of fact,

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:59.050
the Capture Level of the Shining 
Gourami itself is less than 1.

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:01.320
Then it's easy to capture it?!

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:04.130
It's easy enough to get there.

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:07.630
But in the cavern, the Shining 
Gourami has no natural enemies

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:11.670
and has the nutrients of the 
Mors Mountains all to itself.

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:14.300
It has absolutely no sense of cautiousness.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:18.140
What will happen when a 
fish who's known no fear

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:21.540
comes face to face with a strong creature?

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:32.520
Even if Toriko and Sunny reach 
the Shining Gourami's den,

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:37.320
it's likely that the fish will die of shock.

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:41.560
In other words, the strength 
needed to cross Death Falls

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:45.530
is inconsistent with the delicacy required 
to capture a Shining Gourami alive.

00:18:45.530 --> 00:18:49.370
Gourmet National Treasure Granny 
Setsu can easily cross Death Falls,

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:53.440
but because of that strength, she can't 
return with a live Shining Gourami.

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:59.410
It's because the Shining Gourami is 
a Special Preparation Ingredient.

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.530
Alright!

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:32.610
Then only a weak human being can 
capture a Shining Gourami alive?

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:35.180
No, it takes more than that.

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:41.890
I did it! I caught one!

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:45.360
Wow! It's still shining!

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:48.060
What a beautiful fish!

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:53.800
Whether they can successfully 
capture a live one

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:59.040
depends on Komatsu-kun's ability 
to hear the voices of ingredients.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:22.490
What do I do now?!

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:32.990
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:36.930
It's time for Gourmet Fortune, with 
a heaping helping of accuracy!

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:41.740
We're going to use a camera 
later, so get yours ready!

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:45.610
Please choose one of these three platters.

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:50.110
This week's lucky ingredient 
is in one of them!

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:53.510
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:55.950
Alright, here we go!

00:21:55.950 --> 00:22:02.060
A heaping helping... Open!

00:22:02.060 --> 00:22:05.490
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:12.000
A - Unicorn Cerberus Capture Level 63

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:07.890
...yours if you chose A!

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:12.000
Don't miss your heaping helping of a 
huge chance that'll come this week!

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:19.210
B - Cream Mushroom Capture Level 3

00:22:12.900 --> 00:22:16.100
If you chose B, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:19.010
Accept the opinion of an older person.

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:27.680
C - Soy Saucetopus Capture Level <1

00:22:19.970 --> 00:22:22.810
And I'm sorry. If you chose C, you're third.

00:22:22.810 --> 00:22:28.050
You may find a hint to be gobble-gobble 
positive in a song that you like.

00:22:28.050 --> 00:22:31.680
Alright, finally it's Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:31.680 --> 00:22:33.320
Are you ready?

00:22:33.320 --> 00:22:37.020
One of Toriko's friends is going 
to say a few words of wisdom.

00:22:36.320 --> 00:22:41.860
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:37.020 --> 00:22:38.460
If you take a photo of that scene

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:42.090
and carry it with you for a week as a 
good luck charm, you'll be even luckier!

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:44.100
Alright, here we go!

00:22:44.100 --> 00:22:48.230
Three! Two! One! Scoop chance!

00:22:48.230 --> 00:22:50.200
You have faith, huh?

